From: mpv-ht development <dev@mpv-ht.local>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 14:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] gpu-next: size Analyzer xy cells in physical display pixels

Add live 1/2 pixel cells with dynamic grid dimensions and reusable storage
capacity. Keep the legacy full chromaticity readback separate and fixed-size.

